                <pb facs="0848" n="754" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg754"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Number.</p>
                <p>Personal pass, fiscal year 1886–87. Province of Habana. Transient foreigners,
                    gratis.</p>
                <p>Mr. Julio Sanguily, native of Cuba, American citizen, province of id., 41 years
                    of age, married, profession merchant, residing in Lombillo, No. 4, and resides
                    habitually in El Cerro.</p>
                <p>Habana, October 30, 1886.</p>
                <p>By the Governor:</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>] <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >E. Guillerme.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
